        "# Cyclic isolate\n",
        "\n",
        "A cyclic isolate is a group of objects that refer to one another but are no longer reachable from outside the group. Python's cyclic garbage collector can reclaim such objects.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-cyclic-isolate)"
      ]
    }
